# The iOS example resolves Dynamsoft pods, so its lock pins a pod version that
# has to be regenerated on macOS every time the bundled SDK changes — and a
# stale lock makes `pod install` fail instead of updating. CI resolves it fresh.
**/ios/Podfile.lock
